# Line endings: LF in the repository whatever the editor or OS writes (the project moves between Windows and Linux
# machines and containers). Shell scripts and Dockerfiles stay LF in the working tree too.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# binary assets: never touched
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.xlsx binary
*.ttf binary
*.onnx binary
